phrase: bound statistical frequency counter up to {ceiling}
slot: ceiling int
test: list=50,150,200 ceiling=100
expect: => i=100 r=0.0 ok=true s="" errors=0 n=3 res=[50,100,100] cache=0 hits=0
test: list=10,20,30 ceiling=15
